Cartographer (crtgrphr)

This project is built clean-room. It takes conceptual inspiration from Archify
(https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify), an MIT-licensed project, and — through it —
from Cocoon-AI/architecture-diagram-generator (MIT). Ideas such as a typed
diagram IR, semantic node roles, reach tracing, and share cards informed our
design. No source code was copied from those projects.

Should any third-party source ever be reused, it will be vendored in isolation
with its original license header preserved and recorded here and in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.

See docs/decisions/0006-licensing-clean-room.md for the rationale.
